 kindness. Board-certified menopause care, HRT, and lifecycle medicine — delivered nationwide.", "display_url": "kindr.health", "end": 275, "expanded_url": "https://kindr.health", "images": [{"height": 630, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113073004749991936/n1iaoDKL?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113073004749991936/n1iaoDKL?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 252, "status": 200, "title": "Evidence-Based Menopause Care & HRT | Kindr Health", "unwound_url": "https://kindr.health", "url": "https://t.co/pbZkLJkSAZ"}]}, "id": "2114099728979767740", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "On a GLP-1 in perimenopause? ACOG advises stopping 1-2 months before trying to conceive. Weight loss can raise fertility, so talk with your clinician about contraception until menopause. For education only, not medical advice. #menopause #GLP1 More at https://t.co/pbZkLJkSAZ", "url": "https://x.com/kindrhealth/status/2114099728979767740"}, {"author_id": "1977191953897824256", "created_at": "2026-10-24T21:32:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114107761709527458"], "id": "2114107761709527458", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "U.S. births just hit a record low.\n\nThe fertility rate fell to 53.1 births per 1,000 women ages 15-44 in 2025. That's down 23% since 2007 (CDC).\n\nFewer future workers means more pressure on Social Security.\n\nIs money the main reason people are waiting?", "url": "https://x.com/Edpzj243/status/2114107761709527458"}, {"author_id": "1854695895935467521", "created_at": "2026-10-24T21:28:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114106780196462859"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/conchieschirac…", "end": 227, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/conchieschirach/status/2114004171880079404", "start": 204, "url": "https://t.co/nx8q4zhnsW"}]}, "id": "2114106780196462859", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 27, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "The Church teaches that artificial contraception is immoral. Natural Family Planning, which involves observing the woman’s natural fertility signs and abstaining during her fertile times, is permissible. https://t.co/nx8q4zhnsW", "url": "https://x.com/gossmeric/status/2114106780196462859"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2114103266883624960"]}, "author_id": "2031040748229967874", "created_at": "2026-10-24T21:14:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114103286991114684"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 255, "start": 243, "tag": "BothParties"}, {"end": 269, "start": 256, "tag": "CostOfLiving"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/tcc0k6Yv9F", "end": 293, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/RealMarcoRossi/status/2114103286991114684/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114103266883624960", "start": 270, "url": "https://t.co/tcc0k6Yv9F"}]}, "id": "2114103286991114684", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Social Security Trustees: full benefits until Q3 2034 — then about 83%.\nThey cut the long-run fertility assumption from 1.90 to 1.75 kids per woman. Fewer workers. Same promises.\nBoth parties kicked this can. Your payroll tax funds the delay.\n#BothParties #CostOfLiving https://t.co/tcc0k6Yv9F", "url": "https://x.com/RealMarcoRossi/status/2114103286991114684"}, {"author_id": "1917269058564632576", "created_at": "2026-10-24T21:51:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114112652645421222"], "id": "2114112652645421222", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 31, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🚨 U.S. BIRTH RATE HITS RECORD LOW — NEW CDC DA